# Expo App Conventions

## Routing (expo-router)

- `(tabs)/index` — message list (Home)
- `(tabs)/explore` — user directory (Contacts)
- `(tabs)/settings` — settings + logout
- `login` — auth modal; guarded by `context/auth.tsx`
- `chat/[id]` — conversation screen
- `profile/index` — profile edit

## Auth guard

`AuthProvider` uses a public-route allowlist (`login` only) and holds the navigator behind `AuthBootstrap` until Firebase Auth has resolved. Unauthenticated users cannot stay on `/chat/*`, `/profile`, or tabs. Do not add a private route without updating the provider.

## UI patterns

- Use `StyleSheet.create` per screen (existing pattern)
- Colors: `useBrandTheme()` semantic tokens, not one-off hex (see `constants/brand.ts`)
- Accessible controls: `@/components/ui/accessible-field`, `icon-button`, `live-status`
- Touch targets: `minTouchSize` from `constants/a11y` (44 iOS / 48 Android)
- Safe areas: `react-native-safe-area-context`
- Themed components available: `@/components/themed-view`, `themed-text`
- Settings/Profile use `@expo/vector-icons` MaterialIcons

## Platform notes

- Web: `global.css` constrains `#root` to 800px
- Chat uses custom bubbles with `KeyboardAvoidingView`
- Profile avatar: `expo-image-picker` + Firebase Storage

## Error UX

Map Firebase errors to friendly messages (permission-denied, index missing, auth/email-already-in-use).
